# Rendered by the Akamas FileConfigurator task into params.env, then sourced by
# apply_config.sh -> render_statefulset.sh, which validates every value and writes the vLLM
# flags (booleans become --x / --no-x: vLLM 0.29.0 parses them with BooleanOptionalAction
# and rejects --x=true). Every token must be in the study's parametersSelection
# (ignoreUnsubstitutedTokens false), and render_statefulset.sh refuses a leftover token. An EMPTY
# value (a parameter the baseline lists in doNotRenderParameters) means no flag: vLLM's default,
# as the customer's compose.
#
# Domains (study README, "Parameters tuned"; vLLM 0.29.0 source and the 2026-10-09 W4A16 kernel
# probe, ../../../probes/l40s-gemma4-w4a16-kernels/):
#   - LINEAR_BACKEND auto (Marlin on SM 8.9), humming. triton out: -49 % ms/token at 16 requests
#     in the probe. conch / exllama do not start for this checkpoint.
#   - MOE_BACKEND auto (Marlin), humming. triton out: -41 % on the mixed load even with tuned
#     configs; flashinfer_trtllm does not start on SM 8.9.
#   - ATTENTION_BACKEND: not tuned (no line): Gemma4Config forces TRITON_ATTN on SM 8.9.
#   - SPEC_METHOD / SPEC_TOKENS: Gemma 4's MTP drafter; none <-> 0 by parameterConstraints. The
#     probe saw 0 prefix-cache hits with MTP on (24 of 24 follow-up turns): the study weighs that.
#   - LONG_PREFILL_TOKEN_THRESHOLD: fixed off (empty = vLLM's default 0), not tuned: every value study 35
#     measured lost (2048 -6 %, 121 -36 %, 407 below the MTP configurations), and its 0 = off at the
#     edge of [0, 8192] is hard to optimize (study 35 README, running notes).
#   - WNA16_ACTIVATION_DTYPE (vLLM pack 1.14.0): auto (W4A16) or fp8 (Marlin W4A8-FP8 and Humming fp8
#     input: VLLM_MARLIN_INPUT_DTYPE / VLLM_HUMMING_INPUT_QUANT_CONFIG). int8 out: Marlin int8 broke
#     the output in the W4A16 probe (0/40).
#   - SCHEDULING_POLICY: fixed fcfs (vLLM's default), not tuned: the replay sends no priorities.
#   - ENFORCE_EAGER: fixed false: eager / O0 ran ~7x slower at batch 1 (study 30's probe).
GPU_MEMORY_UTILIZATION=${vllm.gpu_memory_utilization}
MAX_NUM_SEQS=${vllm.max_num_seqs}
MAX_NUM_BATCHED_TOKENS=${vllm.max_num_batched_tokens}
KV_CACHE_DTYPE=${vllm.kv_cache_dtype}
PERFORMANCE_MODE=${vllm.performance_mode}
OPTIMIZATION_LEVEL=${vllm.optimization_level}
ENFORCE_EAGER=false
SCHEDULING_POLICY=
ASYNC_SCHEDULING=${vllm.async_scheduling}
MAX_CUDAGRAPH_CAPTURE_SIZE=${vllm.max_cudagraph_capture_size}
BLOCK_SIZE=${vllm.block_size}
LINEAR_BACKEND=${vllm.linear_backend}
MOE_BACKEND=${vllm.moe_backend}
SPEC_METHOD=${vllm.spec_method}
SPEC_TOKENS=${vllm.spec_tokens}
LONG_PREFILL_TOKEN_THRESHOLD=
WNA16_ACTIVATION_DTYPE=${vllm.wna16_activation_dtype}
WATERMARK=${vllm.watermark}
SCHEDULER_RESERVE_FULL_ISL=${vllm.scheduler_reserve_full_isl}
STREAM_INTERVAL=${vllm.stream_interval}
